                  Live Site Preview
                </span>
                <span id="preview-division-badge" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 shadow-3xs">
                  BOTH SCOPE
                </span>
